<title>USA: First Fla. Commission deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>First Fla. Commission deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Willaim R. Hough &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced First Florida Governmental Financing Commission's $26 million bond deal, raising yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>FIRST FLORIDA GOVERNMENTAL FINANCING COMMISSION</p>
<p>RE: $26,035,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(Broward County and the Cities of Hollywood and St. Petersburg, FL)</p>
<p>NO UNDERLYING RATING</p>
<p>  MOODY'S:		     S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 04/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
